items.BT_Tyrants_Cowl.name=Cowl of the Storm Tyrant
items.BT_Tyrants_Cowl.description=The first tyrant begged the heavens for mercy. The second learned to command them. Beneath this blackened crown, a violet gaze keeps the final lesson: a storm has no conscience, and neither should the hand that guides it.\n\nRequires primary Mage or an ascension on the Mage path to equip. Secondary Mage alone does not qualify.\n+18 Health, +30 Mana. Physical/Projectile resistance: 9%; Lightning resistance: 8%.\nMage affinity: +8% Sorcery. This piece must be in its correct slot and unbroken; no full set required. Native formulas and caps apply.
items.BT_Dominion_Mantle.name=Mantle of Black Dominion
items.BT_Dominion_Mantle.description=Obsidian ribs close around a heart of captive thunder. Every channel beneath this mantle was etched with a surrendered name; every pale flash is a promise that its owner will never again kneel. The storm does not lend its strength. It collects what it is owed.\n\nRequires primary Mage or an ascension on the Mage path to equip. Secondary Mage alone does not qualify.\n+36 Health, +40 Mana. Physical/Projectile resistance: 16%; Lightning resistance: 12%.\nMage affinity: +8% Flow. This piece must be in its correct slot and unbroken; no full set required. Native formulas and caps apply.\nCompanion: a primary Mage wearing the original AB's Tickle Time also gains +6% native Haste. This improves movement, not the lightning pulse rate.
items.BT_Stormbound_Strides.name=Strides of the Hollow Tempest
items.BT_Stormbound_Strides.description=These divided robes have crossed battlefields where the rain fell upward and no witness kept their shadow. Dark plates conceal the price of each measured step: another breath stolen from the world, another moment granted to its unrepentant master.\n\nRequires primary Mage or an ascension on the Mage path to equip. Secondary Mage alone does not qualify.\n+26 Health, +20 Mana, +3 Stamina. Physical/Projectile resistance: 13%; Lightning resistance: 6%.\nMage affinity: +8 Life Force (Health attribute points). This piece must be in its correct slot and unbroken; no full set required. Native formulas and caps apply.
blackTempest.classRestriction=Black Tempest armor requires a primary Mage class or its ascended path.
blackTempest.returnPending=Black Tempest gear is safely held until inventory space is available.
